# API contracts

`frontend/app/shared/schemas/` (Zod) must mirror `backend/schemas.py` (Pydantic). Change both in the same task.

Keep aligned: `ResumeRequest` (`personal`, `skills`, `experience`, `education`, `target_job`, `language`, `template`), `GenerateResponse` (`id`, `resume_text`, `generated_by`, `language`, `template`, `analysis`), auth (`UserRegister` including `role` `seeker`|`hr` default `seeker`, `UserLogin`, `TokenResponse`, `UserOut` including `role`), library (`ResumeSummary`, `ResumeDetail`), HR/jobs (`CompanyCreate`/`CompanyUpdate`/`CompanyOut`, `VacancyCreate`/`VacancyUpdate`/`VacancyOut`, `JobOut`, `ApplyRequest`, `SeekerApplicationOut`, `HrApplicationOut`, `HrDashboard`/`SeekerDashboard`).

```ts
// ❌ BAD — extra field; backend will 422
export const resumeRequestSchema = z.object({
  personal: personalInfoSchema,
  headline: z.string()
})

// ✅ GOOD — same fields as schemas.py
export const resumeRequestSchema = z.object({
  personal: personalInfoSchema,
  skills: z.array(z.string()).default([]),
  experience: z.array(experienceItemSchema).default([]),
  education: z.string().default(''),
  target_job: z.string().default(''),
  language: resumeLanguageSchema.default('kk'),
  template: resumeTemplateSchema.default('classic')
})
```

Parse API payloads with these schemas in `*.api.ts`. Do not invent extra envelope fields.
